# Four loop iterations train a taken branch, then require recovery at loop exit.
# The later taken BEQ skips a store and a register overwrite on the wrong path.
# Expected R1=4, R3=108, R4=112, R5=113, F3=3.
# Mem[0] must remain 10; Mem[4] becomes 3. Committed instructions: 17.
Integer adder   12   2       1
FP adder        4    3       1
FP multiplier   2    8       1
Load/store unit 8    1   3   1
ROB entries = 48
R1=0, R2=4, R3=100, F1=1, F2=2
Mem[0]=10, Mem[4]=20

Addi R1 R1 1
Addi R3 R3 2
Bne R1 R2 -3
Add R4 R1 R3
Beq R1 R2 2
Sd F2 0(R0)
Addi R3 R3 999
Add.d F3 F1 F2
Sd F3 4(R0)
Addi R5 R4 1
